<https://ontology.metareasoning.ai/core#Concept> a skos:Concept ;
    skos:broader <https://ontology.metareasoning.ai/regulatory/vocabulary/core> ;
    skos:definition "A named idea used across products (e.g. AUM, drift index)."@en ;
    skos:inScheme <https://ontology.metareasoning.ai/regulatory/vocabulary/core/scheme> ;
    skos:prefLabel "Concept"@en .

<https://ontology.metareasoning.ai/core#Entity> a skos:Concept ;
